text_en:
The revenue of the reserve shall be as follows:
Net insurance premiums;
Revenues from operation of the reserve;
Surpluses accrued at the settlement of revenues and expenditures;
Reimbursed amount of principal and interest of loans;
Revenues from management of property that belong to the reserve;
Rental deposits;Other revenues.
The expenditure of the reserve shall be as follows:
Insurance proceeds, refunds, and other insurance benefits;
Amount of transfer to the Account;
Money expended for the business referred to in the subparagraphs of Article 6 (1) of the Act ;
Refund of rental deposits and fees for entrusted management.
[This Article Wholly Amended by Presidential Decree No. 21570, Jun. 26, 2009]

